<title>USA: Preliminary list of cult members in mass suicide.</title>
<headline>Preliminary list of cult members in mass suicide.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO SANTA FE, Calif. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a preliminary police list of the 39 bodies found at site of a mass suicide involving a cult called &quot;Heaven's Gate&quot;.</p>
<p>Police said Thursday names will not be released until next of kin are notified.</p>
